"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /></head><body "
"style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Bitstream Vera Sans\">\n"
"<p><span style=\"font-weight:600\">About</span></p>\n"
"<p>Gubed is a PHP debugger available for free through GPL. This plugin "
"integrates Gubed with Quanta. </p>\n"
"<p>"
"In order to use this plugin for PHP debugging, you need to get the Quanta "
"package from the Gubed project page, <a "
"href=\"http://sourceforge.net/projects/gubed\">"
"http://sourceforge.net/projects/gubed</a>, at SourceForge </p>\n"
"<p>For more info about Gubed, please visit the Gubed website at <a "
"href=\"http://gubed.sf.net\">http://gubed.sf.net</a> </p>\n"
"<p><span style=\"font-weight:600\">Technical Details</span></p>\n"
"<p>This version of the debugger supports the %PROTOCOLVERSION% version of "
"the Gubed protocol. </p>\n"
